  "description": "Engineered for the unruly, the URS 01 LT ONE hits that rare sweet spot most gravel bikes can only dream of: turning irregular terrain into a playground. BMC 01 Premium Carbon layup? Yes. Low-maintenance? As much as we could. Capable of extreme gravel? Absolutely. Emotionally supportive? Weirdly, yes.\nIts 20mm Micro Travel Technology integrated into the fork and seatstays gives you the confidence (and recklessness) to stay in the saddle through rocks, ruts, chatter and chaos. Because you can still send it on a gravel bike.\nWe paired that capability with the ultra-reliable SRAM Rival XPLR AXS groupset for wide-range gearing and precise shifting, making sure the bike keeps up even when your better judgement doesn’t.\nThe BMC AG 20 gravel-specific wheelset is tough enough for anything you point it at, paired with 45mm tires to bully the terrain into submission (you can even go to 47mm). Add storage, mounts, integration, cockpit adjustability and more, and you’re looking at the adventure gravel bike of your dreams.\nStop waiting for perfect conditions and start selecting the worst line on purpose.",
